WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,040
Shouldn't I have saved the corpse king from my previous life?

2
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:05,560
Thank you. I owe you twice.

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:06,600
Remember to pay me back in the future

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:10,400
Especially since Jinhe still owes me twenty-two good sisters.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:23,290
Others have trouble condensing a small water ball

6
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:26,010
When you return your hand, it becomes a whole wall of water

7
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:27,930
Sister, you are also a capable person

8
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:29,930
Are you all okay?

9
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:31,130
The rich second class is so cruel

10
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:33,150
No one died

11
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:34,150
By the way, sis

12
00:00:34,150 --> 00:00:36,430
What are you doing here for?

13
00:00:36,430 --> 00:00:38,950
Do you want us to help you?

14
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:42,600
Can you help me with our brand?

15
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,760
Can we put up our sign?
